! TDDFT mode matrix 05/16 -- global hybrid + TDA  (B3LYP)
!
! First case where BOTH the XC kernel and the exact-exchange OOVV
! block are present (c_hf = 0.20).  The peak-memory forecast switches
! to its phase-2 branch here.
%method  B3LYP
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%charge  0
%mult    1
%tddft   3
%tddft_tda on
%tddft_multiplicity singlet
%geom angstrom
O    0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
H    0.000000    0.757200   -0.469200
H    0.000000   -0.757200   -0.469200
*end
